OL,3,GNEWSADog rescued after 30ft fall during
OL,4,AStorm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog which fell 30ft (9m) down a hole
OL,7,Fduring Storm Boelo is "back to normal"
OL,8,Fafter being saved by mountain rescuers,
OL,9,Fits owner has said.
OL,11,FFreddie, a Cocker Spaniel, was out
OL,12,Fwalking with owner Tom Hollingworth on
OL,13,FSunday near The Stang, a moorland ridge
OL,14,Foften considered the border of North
OL,15,FYorkshire and County Durham.
OL,17,FFreddie fell and disappeared into a
OL,18,Fconcealed pothole at about 10:00 GMT,
OL,19,Fprompting a rescue operation after the
OL,20,Fdog failed to respond to its owner's
OL,21,Fcalls and whistles.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
