OL,3,GNEWSADog rescued after 30ft fall during
OL,4,AStorm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,F"He was pottering about in some rushes
OL,7,Fnext to me and he just never came out
OL,8,Fof the rushes," said Hollingworth.
